href="/zh/" hreflang="zh" lang="zh" aria-current="true">中文</a><a class="LanguageMenu-link" href="/ja/" hreflang="ja" lang="ja">日本語</a></div></details></div><h1>Breaker Delta</h1><bd-island name="ThemeSwitch" props="{&quot;toDark&quot;:&quot;切换到深色模式&quot;,&quot;toLight&quot;:&quot;切换到浅色模式&quot;}"><button type="button" class="ThemeSwitch"><svg class="ThemeSwitch-icon" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><circle class="ThemeSwitch-ring" cx="10" cy="10" r="7.5" stroke-width="2"></circle><path class="ThemeSwitch-half" d="M10 2.5 A7.5 7.5 0 0 1 10 17.5 Z"></path></svg><span class="ThemeSwitch-name ThemeSwitch-to-dark">切换到深色模式</span><span class="ThemeSwitch-name ThemeSwitch-to-light">切换到浅色模式</span></button></bd-island></header><main class="page"><section class="Band" aria-labelledby="band-front"><div class="Band-rail"><h2 id="band-front" class="Band-name">头版</h2></div><div class="Band-body"><p>14:00 版。海况：有浪。16 个浪，今天新成 5 个。</p><ol><li><a href="/zh/topic/chipmaker-board-founder-ceo" lang="zh">芯片厂董事会排除创始人回归 CEO 的可能</a> <data value="196">196</data></li><li><a href="/zh/topic/ai-lab-sued-over-agents" lang="zh">州检察长就 80 起失控智能体事件起诉一家 AI 实验室</a> <data value="181">181</data></li><li><a href="/zh/topic/six-banks-offline" lang="zh">美国六家银行同一个下午相继宕机</a> <data value="171">171</data></li><li><a href="/zh/topic/ai-hacking-tool-warning" lang="zh">安全机构就一款开源 AI 黑客工具发出警告</a> <data value="151">151</data></li><li><a href="/zh/topic/frontier-model-backlash" lang="zh">新旗舰模型的跑分与争议持续发酵</a> <data value="144">144</data></li><li><a href="/zh/topic/decoy-discounts" lang="zh">黑五假折扣：351 个优惠中 29% 并不省钱</a> <data value="131">131</data></li><li><a href="/zh/topic/open-weights-quarter-price" lang="en">Open-weights model released with pricing at 25% of flagship</a> <data value="126">126</data></li><li><a href="/zh/topic/assistant-wallet" lang="zh">聊天助手有了钱包，开始替你付款</a> <data value="124">124</data></li><li><a href="/zh/topic/airline-bans-booking-agents" lang="zh">航空公司禁止 AI 智能体订票</a> <data value="99">99</data></li><li><a href="/zh/topic/super-agent-flash-model" lang="zh">实验室发布超级智能体和更快的 flash 模型</a> <data value="80">80</data></li><li><a href="/zh/topic/browser-agent-permissions" lang="en">Browser vendor adds a permissions prompt for agents</a> <data value="74">74</data></li><li><a href="/zh/topic/cloud-outage-postmortem" lang="en">Postmortem of last week's inference outage</a> <data value="68">68</data></li><li><a href="/zh/topic/robotaxi-permit-expands" lang="en">Robotaxi permit expands to two more cities</a> <data value="63">63</data></li><li><a href="/zh/topic/retailer-extension-recall" lang="en">Retailer recalls a browser extension after a data leak</a> <data value="57">57</data></li><li><a href="/zh/topic/context-registry-opens" lang="en">A public registry for agent tool servers opens</a> <data value="49">49</data></li><li><a href="/zh/topic/quantum-error-rate-claim" lang="en">Quantum startup claims a record low error rate</a> <data value="44">44</data></li></ol></div></section><section class="Band" aria-labelledby="band-tide"><div class="Band-rail"><h2 id="band-tide" class="Band-name">潮汐表</h2><p class="Band-note">今天成浪的故事，画在它成形的钟点上。几条浪成形的时间挨得近，海面就涨得高。</p></div><div class="Band-body"><div class="TideTable"><div class="TideTable-chart"><svg class="TideTable-svg" role="img" aria-label="今天有 5 个故事成了浪，时间在 08:00 到 14:00 之间。"><svg class="TideTable-sea" viewBox="0 0 960 270" preserveAspectRatio="none" width="100%" height="100%" aria-hidden="true"><g class="TideTable-crest"><path class="TideTable-area" d="M0,220 C1.7,219.7 6.7,218.7 10,218.2 C13.3,217.7 16.7,217.4 20,217.2 C23.3,217 26.7,216.9 30,217.1 C33.3,217.3 36.7,217.7 40,218.2 C43.3,218.7 46.7,219.4 50,220 C53.3,220.6 56.7,221.2 60,221.7 C63.3,222.2 66.7,222.6 70,222.8 C73.3,223 76.7,223.1 80,222.9 C83.3,222.7 86.7,222.3 90,221.8 C93.3,221.3 96.7,220.7 100,220.1 C103.3,219.5 106.7,218.8 110,218.3 C113.3,217.8 116.7,217.4 120,217.2 C123.3,217 126.7,217 130,217.1 C133.3,217.3 136.7,217.7 140,218.1 C143.3,218.6 146.7,219.2 