: <a href="https://tech-media.example/item/41010" lang="en">Chip export rules, explained in five charts</a></li><li>DEV.to top posts: <a href="https://devto.example/item/41011" lang="en">A keyboard firmware that learns your typos</a></li></ul><p><small>サンプルデータです。</small></p></div></section></main></body></html>"
